+From 2faf1fc9ec975c564f4a967896c278922d8a252f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: Small Bricktory <studio@smallbricktory.com>
+Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 11:10:02 -0700
+Subject: [PATCH] deinterlace: remove the GPL-2+ yadif and yadif2x modes
+
+yadif.h and yadif_template.h come from MPlayer/FFmpeg under GPL-2+.
+Drop them and their LGPL wrapper algo_yadif.c/.h from the deinterlace
+plugin, and remove yadif/yadif2x from every deinterlace mode list
+(plugin, core option, vout, libvlc_video_set_deinterlace). The default
+mode auto maps to x, which stays.
