+From d5fd432e4e639b6fa1eb94dafd80b889e063bc0d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: Small Bricktory <studio@smallbricktory.com>
+Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 11:35:02 -0700
+Subject: [PATCH] contrib: ffmpeg: do not build the GPL-2+ aarch64 AC-3 DSP
+ code
+
+FFmpeg's libavcodec/aarch64/ac3dsp_init_aarch64.c and ac3dsp_neon.S
+carry GPL-2+ headers but are built without --enable-gpl. Patch them out
+of the aarch64 build; the AC-3 DSP functions (AC-3 encoder only) use
+the C versions.
+---
+ .../avcodec-aarch64-no-gpl-ac3dsp.patch       | 35 +++++++++++++++++++
+ contrib/src/ffmpeg/rules.mak                  |  1 +
+ 2 files changed, 36 insertions(+)
