++avcodec/aarch64: do not build the GPL-2+ AC-3 DSP NEON code
++
++libavcodec/aarch64/ac3dsp_init_aarch64.c and ac3dsp_neon.S carry GPL-2+
++headers and are built without --enable-gpl. Drop them; AC-3 DSP falls
++back to the C functions (used by the AC-3 encoder).
++
++--- a/libavcodec/ac3dsp.c	2026-10-28 11:34:41
+++++ b/libavcodec/ac3dsp.c	2026-10-28 11:34:41
++@@ -389,9 +389,7 @@
